mai del tutto. Ne abbiamo parlato con @alecattelan e abbiamo anche capito che nel mondo esistono due tipi di persone: i buchi neri e le scintilline. Ascoltate la puntata e diteci chi siete. #tuttelevolteche", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuZXhwZXJpbWVudGFsIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHGIMZEWBj0RbEHTrZ2-VlAe1PT5P6szxDHnnK08QTezUQ8TNsbBSbWLhniVoPG2C0&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=a-rb_FkfFx4kNi5ii8t8AQ&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af-axB8Zmz3zsh03yixNSpfUINuPS7l_C1qdZaJ7afutzg&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Rivers of ink have been spilled on what is precise and how to achieve happiness, yet it is a topic that never completely exhausts. We talked about it with @alecattelan and we also understood that there are two kinds of people in the world: black holes and sparks. Listen to the episode and tell us who you are. #tuttelevolteche"}, "comment_count": 49, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "feed_post_reshare_disabled": false, "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "third_party_downloads_enabled": 2, "eligible_for_text_app_activation_badge": false, "account_type": 3, "can_see_quiet_post_attribution": true, "account_badges": [], "full_name": "Camihawke", "has_anonymous_prof